-- UNAPPLIED exact-target template only. Owner binds the already-reviewed dedicated LOGIN privately.
-- No identity creation, role membership, credentials, capability activation or SQL installation.
-- Login must be non-superuser/no-bypass/no-create/no-replication and have no memberships,
-- raw business table/column access, schema CREATE or other reachable definer EXECUTE.
